Stellar Registry (stellar-registry)
-----------------------------------
The mainnet index supplies public names in channel/name form. Contract instances
are checked in Soroban RPC. Registry names carry an unverified label status.

https://stellar.rgstry.xyz/
https://stellar-registry-mainnet.fly.dev/v1/contracts

